Upstream attribution and scope of this license

This project is a derivative work. Its base Learning Management System
(authentication, roles, courses, classes, enrollments, sessions, materials,
assignments, forums, the admin panel and the core Prisma schema) comes from
the repository LMS_StLouis2 by Josesdio30 and its contributors:

    https://github.com/Josesdio30/LMS_StLouis2

That repository did not include a license file when this derivative was
prepared (checked 2026-10-22). Copyright in the upstream code therefore
remains with its original author(s), and the MIT License above is NOT granted
by them. Nothing in this file licenses, or claims ownership of, the upstream
code or any part of it that remains in this repository.

Scope of this license: the MIT License above covers only the original work
added in this repository by Galeno Areliano, namely the AI-assisted grading
pipeline, the retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and embedding backend, the
plagiarism detection module, the AUX database and its migration runner, the
setup tooling, tests, CI configuration and operational documentation, and the
modifications made to upstream files.

Anyone who wants to reuse or redistribute this repository beyond the original
additions should first obtain permission from the upstream author(s), or wait
for them to publish a license for LMS_StLouis2.

Third-party dependencies are distributed under their own licenses.
